{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年。春王二月癸酉朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"二、三月己巳，〈木巳〉伯匄卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"三、夏，邾婁鼻我來奔。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"邾婁鼻我者何？邾婁大夫也。邾婁無大夫，此何以書？以近書也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"四、葬〈木巳〉孝公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"五、陳殺其大夫慶虎及慶寅。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"六、陳侯之弟光自楚歸于陳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"七、晉欒盈復入于晉，入于曲沃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"曲沃者何？晉之邑也。其言入于晉，入于曲沃何？欒盈將入晉，晉人不納，由乎曲沃而入也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊侯伐衞，遂伐晉。八月，叔孫豹帥師救晉，次于雍渝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"曷為先言救而後言次？先通君命也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"九、己卯，仲孫遬卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"十、冬十月乙亥，臧孫紇出奔邾婁。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"十一、晉人殺欒盈。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"曷為不言殺其大夫？非其大夫也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_172_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_172","textTraditional":"十二、齊侯襲莒。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}